{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>FSCamera 是一款主打全螢幕構圖的拍攝工具，支援照片與影片，並可在相容裝置上同時以前後鏡頭捕捉眼前景物與自己的反應。它提供即時濾鏡、美顏與影像增強、對焦及曝光控制，以及可選音訊與多種解像度。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費，適合喜歡自拍、記錄反應或創作雙畫面內容的 iPhone 與 iPad 用戶。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-65.webp\">\n<h2>雙鏡同步與即時濾鏡</h2>\n<p>在全螢幕介面拍攝照片與影片，可切換模式、設定倒數及變焦。相容裝置支援前後鏡頭同步拍攝，可分別儲存、合併畫面或選用子母畫面，合併畫面按方向並排或堆疊。內置彩色、黑白、復古與像素藝術濾鏡，兩個鏡頭可套用不同效果；另備美顏、影像增強、對焦測光及鎖定，影片可選音訊與 4K 解像度。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-83-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-84-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-85-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-86-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-87-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：FSCamera – Full Screen Camera</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T05:22:40.308058+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":372,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T05:00:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T08:38:35.893392+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T05:18:23.564712+00:00","content_hash":"7506b6db30b84b05dc2d217c2acb9d4249e1bf612b2bd84affc360b4b15f5d88","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}